                  <div class="min-w-0">
                    <strong class="text-white group-hover:text-blue-200 transition-colors text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold block truncate">“Kâr ediyoruz ama kasada para yok.”</strong>
                    <span class="block text-[11px] text-slate-300">Nakit akışı · tahsilat · ödeme dengesi</span>
                  </div>
                </a>

                <a href="#teshis" class="group flex items-center gap-3 p-2.5 rounded-xl bg-white/[0.08] hover:bg-white/[0.16] border border-white/15 hover:border-blue-400 transition-all duration-200 hover:translate-x-1">
