                  <div class="min-w-0">
                    <strong class="text-white group-hover:text-blue-200 transition-colors text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold block truncate">“Kimden ne zaman para alacağımız net değil.”</strong>
                    <span class="block text-[11px] text-slate-300">Cari yaşlandırma · tahsilat önceliği</span>
                  </div>
                </a>

                <a href="#teshis" class="group flex items-center gap-3 p-2.5 rounded-xl bg-white/[0.08] hover:bg-white/[0.16] border border-white/15 hover:border-blue-400 transition-all duration-200 hover:translate-x-1">
                  <span class="w-5 h-5 rounded-lg bg-blue-600 border border-blue-400 text-white flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-black shrink-0 group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform">3</span>
                  <div class="min-w-0">
